messages:  [["Please act as a judge and solve the product problem in the given template.\n####\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of <<number1 such as 27>> and <<number2 such as 153>>?\n# Reasoning:\nLet's think step by step. <<number2 153 has three digits, so that we can reason in three steps.>>\n1. <<Multiply number1 27 by the ones place digit 3 of number2 153>>\n2. <<Multiply number1 27 by the tens place digit 50 of number2 153>>\n<<other digits of number2 if it has>>\nAnswer:\nNow, sum all the step results: <<sum of the results>>.\nSo, the final computed product is <<answer>>.\n####\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of 217 and 945?\n# Reasoning:", "<think>\n.\nFirst, I need to multiply 217 by each digit of 945, starting from the ones place.\n\nI'll begin by multiplying 217 by 5, which gives me 1085.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 217 by 40 (the tens place). This results in 8680.\n\nThen, I'll multiply 217 by 900 (the hundreds place), which equals 195300</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
